## 13. Troubleshooting Reference

| Symptom | Where to look |
|---|---|
| Agent ISO boots but node not discovered | `ssh core@<node>` → `journalctl -u agent -f`; check DNS/NTP/MAC in agent-config |
| Rendezvous host stuck "waiting for hosts" | Other nodes' NTP skew, wrong MAC, duplicate IP, LB health check on 6443 |
| `ImagePullBackOff` on `quay.io/...` | IDMS not applied / registry CA not trusted → `oc get idms`, check `/etc/containers/registries.conf` on node |
| CatalogSource not READY | `oc -n openshift-marketplace logs <catalog-pod>`; image path mismatch with mirror |
| MCP Degraded after config | `oc describe mcp <pool>`; `oc get mcp -o yaml | grep -A5 conditions`; node `journalctl -u machine-config-daemon` |
| etcd slow / leader elections | `oc -n openshift-etcd exec -it <etcd-pod> -- etcdctl endpoint status -w table`; disk fsync metrics in Prometheus |
| CSRs pending after node add/reboot | `oc get csr -o name | xargs oc adm certificate approve` |
| Ingress route 503 | Router pods on infra nodes? `oc get pods -n openshift-ingress -o wide`; LB backend health |
| Collect diagnostics | `oc adm must-gather --image=registry.example.com:8443/openshift4/ose-must-gather:latest` |

